<title>SINGAPORE: NOL 1996 final dividend cut to 2.5 pct.</title>
<headline>NOL 1996 final dividend cut to 2.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neptune Orient Lines Ltd said on Wednesday it was proposing a final dividend of 2.5 percent for 1996, down from 5.5 percent in 1995.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
